  "body": "This elevated weatherboard home delivers space on a grand scale, with six bedrooms, three separate living areas, three family bathrooms plus an ensuite, and outdoor living across both levels. The clever layout gives large or extended families room to come together for dinner, spread out for movie nights or enjoy a little independence, while decks and a private backyard set the scene for relaxed coastal living.\r\n\r\nWith Fisherman's Cove reserve right across the road, your next fishing adventure is just moments away. Picture lazy afternoons by the water, fresh fish for dinner and the best of coastal living right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Six bedrooms across two spacious levels\r\n* Great layout for extended family living or teenagers needing their own space \r\n* 809sqm freehold land area \r\n* Three living areas, including a second lounge and separate family room upstairs\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and living downstairs\r\n* Decks for outdoor living and entertaining on both levels\r\n* 3x heat pumps for year round comfort \r\n* Double garaging plus off-street parking with room for the boat \r\n* Three family bathrooms plus an ensuite off the master bedroom\r\n\r\nJust up the road, Whangaparaoa Golf Course is perfect for a leisurely round, while the beautiful walking tracks and native wildlife of Shakespear Regional Park invite you to get out and explore. Gulf Harbour Village, the marina, local cafes and restaurants, and the convenient ferry service to Auckland's CBD are all just moments away. With excellent schooling, including Wentworth College and Primary, plus childcare and public transport close by, this is a location that effortlessly balances coastal lifestyle with everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nWhether you need space for a growing family, independent living for extended family or flexibility to work from home, this home is great value and well worth a closer look. Come and experience just how much room you could have - get in touch today to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nDEADLINE SALE: Closes Wednesday 25th November at 4:00pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/KSAL \r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
